latest_status_2026_06_29_browser_converted_trained_all_route: `browser-converted-trained-bundle ... all` now stages converted-trained f32/q8/q4 artifacts plus sidecars under one q4-defaulted selector root, and `converted-trained-registry-file` proves real selector/model/manifest fetches for all three entries; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/browser-converted-trained-all-route-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_30_browser_converted_trained_source_evidence: Converted-trained browser bundle entries now copy the reviewed `source.manifest` into `evidence/<candidate-id>/converted-trained.source.manifest`, carry selector source-manifest path/checksum/kind/status fields, and browser-verify the source manifest before selected converted model bytes; `converted-trained-source-manifest-drift` proves checksum drift stops before q8 bytes, and durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/browser-converted-trained-source-evidence-memory-2026-06-30.md.
latest_status_2026_06_30_browser_converted_trained_source_identity: Converted-trained selector entries now carry `source_manifest_source_kind`, `source_manifest_source_id`, and `source_manifest_model_shape`; app.js verifies the fetched source snapshot identity before converted `.slm` bytes, safetensors bundle tests assert `trained-export` checkpoint identity, and `converted-trained-source-identity-drift` proves checksum-matched source-id drift stops before q8 bytes; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/browser-converted-trained-source-identity-memory-2026-06-30.md.
latest_status_2026_06_30_browser_converted_trained_source_provenance: Browser Model Provenance now renders verified converted-trained source snapshot/id/shape rows after source-manifest identity checks; compact converted-trained and ui-audit smokes assert fixture values and deterministic fallback; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/browser-converted-trained-source-provenance-memory-2026-06-30.md.
latest_status_2026_06_30_browser_converted_trained_runtime_eval: Converted-trained and safetensors browser bundle entries now run native eval sidecars before selector admission, accept optional eval-cases paths, leave failed eval sidecars for review, and stop before writing admission when eval cases fail; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/browser-converted-trained-runtime-eval-memory-2026-06-30.md.
latest_status_2026_06_30_browser_converted_trained_eval_evidence: Converted-trained selector entries now carry `eval_path`; the browser fetches and checksum-verifies `converted-trained.eval`, recomputes the case-ledger digest, and `converted-trained-eval-evidence-drift` stops before q8 bytes; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/browser-converted-trained-eval-evidence-memory-2026-06-30.md.
latest_status_2026_06_30_safetensors_browser_bundle: `tinyrustlm-slm-pack browser-safetensors-trained-bundle` now extracts local safetensors into a preserved raw source directory, validates it, and stages a converted-trained browser selector root with f32/q8_0/q4_0/all output selection; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/safetensors-browser-bundle-memory-2026-06-30.md.
latest_status_2026_06_30_safetensors_candidate_review: `review-safetensors-candidate` now writes a pre-extraction real-checkpoint report with source/config/tokenizer/license/reference/eval routes, exact `.slm` byte estimate, selector budget fit, context/KV-cache budget fields, and `required_next_gate=extract-raw-f32-tensors`; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/safetensors-candidate-review-memory-2026-06-30.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_safetensors_trained_conversion: `tinyrustlm-slm-pack convert-safetensors-trained` now accepts local or Hugging Face Llama safetensors tensor names, preserves a raw f32 source directory, validates it, and writes converted-trained f32/q8_0/q4_0 `.slm` artifacts with manifests; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/safetensors-trained-conversion-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_safetensors_source_extraction: `tinyrustlm-slm-pack extract-safetensors-source` now copies F32 and decodes F16/BF16 safetensors payloads into raw f32 trained-source directories with reviewed source manifests accepted by `validate-source`; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/safetensors-source-extraction-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_safetensors_source_plan: `tinyrustlm-slm-pack plan-safetensors-source` now maps local safetensors tensor directories into supported raw f32 trained-source layouts with tensor names, exact shapes, copy/decode actions, raw output files, and mapping checksums before extraction; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/safetensors-source-plan-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_safetensors_inspection: `tinyrustlm-slm-pack inspect-safetensors` now validates local safetensors tensor directories for dtype byte widths, shapes, contiguous offsets, and report checksums before future raw-source conversion; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/safetensors-inspection-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_parent_pool_evolution_schedule: `parent-pool-recipe` now writes a checksum-bound `population-based-parent-pool-replay-v1` schedule for sign-merge and soup operator families, selected parent seed weights, and population fitness echoes; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/parent-pool-evolution-schedule-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_operator_schedule_carry_forward: Sign-merge and soup operator receipts carry parent-pool evolution schedule identity, scheduled family index, command, selection rule, output gate, and checksum; candidate manifests, promotion templates, admissions, selector registries, and browser Model Provenance Schedule rows preserve them, with mixed-root proof for sign-merge family 0 and soup family 1 plus `generated-selector-schedule-source-drift` fallback before generated routes; durable routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/operator-schedule-carry-forward-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_tiny_model_runtime_research: Seven new Improvement research files are preserved under raw/runtime-mirust/report-intake-2026-06-29/ and routed through wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/report-intake-index-2026-06-29.md plus wiki/runtime-mirust/research/tiny-model-runtime-memory-reference-ideas-2026-06-29.md for tiny-model candidate selection, Rust/WASM runtime patterns, deterministic model-breeding metadata, and memory distribution guidance.
latest_status_2026_06_29_tiny_model_candidate_matrix: wiki/runtime-mirust/research/tiny-model-candidate-matrix-2026-06-29.md turns the 2026-06-29 tiny-model intake into a metadata-only conversion order: Xenova 15M q8/q4 first, Aurelius GQA, StorySupra untied Llama, Pythia GPT-NeoX validation, and Xenova 42M q4 pressure.
latest_status_2026_06_29_two_parent_operator_browser_provenance: Blend, task-delta, and sparse task-delta compact selector registry proof is now routed through `blend-operator-registry`, `delta-operator-registry`, and `sparse-delta-operator-registry`; the matching receipt-drift modes prove byte-echo fallback to static q8 with Operator unavailable, and durable report routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/two-parent-operator-browser-provenance-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_crossover_operator: Offline deterministic direct-parameter crossover is implemented in tinyrustlm-slm-pack as `crossover-candidate` and `validate-crossover-candidate`; receipts bind seed, parent0 keep rate, selected counts, densities, and mask checksum; browser-smoke `crossover-operator-registry` renders the crossover Operator row, `crossover-operator-receipt-drift` proves byte-echo fallback, and durable report routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/crossover-operator-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_mutation_operator: Offline deterministic bounded mutation is implemented in tinyrustlm-slm-pack as `mutation-candidate` and `validate-mutation-candidate`; receipts bind seed, rate, magnitude, reference scaling, selection checksum, delta checksum, and recomputed candidate bytes; browser-smoke `mutation-operator-registry` renders the mutation Operator row, `mutation-operator-receipt-drift` proves byte-echo fallback, and durable report routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/mutation-operator-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_prune_operator: Offline deterministic magnitude pruning is implemented in tinyrustlm-slm-pack as `prune-candidate` and `validate-prune-candidate`; receipts bind keep/floor ppm, magnitude ranking, selected/pruned counts, mask checksum, output-value checksum, and recomputed candidate bytes; selector tests carry prune receipt fields into `entry.N.operator_receipt_*`, browser-smoke `prune-operator-registry` renders the prune Operator row, `prune-operator-receipt-drift` proves byte-echo fallback, and durable report routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/prune-operator-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_dare_operator: Offline DARE dropout/rescaled task-delta is implemented in tinyrustlm-slm-pack as `dare-candidate` and `validate-dare-candidate`; receipts bind signed delta weight ppm, keep/drop ppm, dropout seed, selected/dropped counts, mask checksum, raw delta checksum, rescaled delta checksum, and recomputed candidate bytes; q8 CLI proof and focused parameter/drift tests route durable memory through wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/dare-operator-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_dare_browser_operator_provenance: DARE compact selector provenance is now routed through `dare-operator-registry`, which renders `receipt-bound / dropout-rescaled-task-delta / 0x00000000000000b7`; `dare-operator-receipt-drift` proves byte fallback to static q8 with Operator unavailable, and durable report routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/dare-browser-operator-provenance-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_federated_operator: Offline federated/local-update is implemented in tinyrustlm-slm-pack as `federated-candidate` and `validate-federated-candidate`; receipts bind base/local-update parent roles, local_update_weight_ppm, local-update counts, raw delta checksum, weighted delta checksum, and recomputed candidate bytes, and durable report routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/federated-operator-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_weighted_soup_operator: Offline parent-pool weighted soup is implemented in tinyrustlm-slm-pack as `soup-candidate` and `validate-soup-candidate`; receipts bind recipe seed weights, direct weighted averaging, parent-weight checksum, weighted-value checksum, changed-from-frontier density, and recomputed candidate bytes, and durable report routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/weighted-soup-operator-memory-2026-06-29.md.
latest_status_2026_06_29_multi_parent_soup_manifest: Multi-parent candidate manifests now accept validated sign-merge or soup parent-pool operator receipts by dispatching on `operator_kind`, recomputing through the owning operator module, writing `candidate_manifest_status=validated-parent-pool-operator-output`, preserving sign or soup metrics, and routing durable memory through wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/multi-parent-soup-manifest-memory-2026-06-29.md.
