latest_status_2026_06_28: Browser Module Plan Trace now verifies one generated `all` root starts on q4_0, switches through q4_0, q8_0, and f32 entries, requests each module plan before model bytes, auto-applies ADP1 plus ASP1 plus ALR1 stacks before generation, and renders the checkpoint chain through ready; durable report routing is in wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/browser-assembly-trace-memory-2026-06-28.md.
